        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "f36c888b-fd6e-32f1-8975-77cb30d59968",
                "word": "Trucmuche",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c7a3acfd-3622-3a5b-8b7c-c3906c5f414a",
                        "entry_id": "f36c888b-fd6e-32f1-8975-77cb30d59968",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Nom imaginaire servant à désigner un quidam ou une personne dont on a oublié le nom."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0db8bb3e-037c-4304-8901-308f0edd5599",
                                "sense_id": "c7a3acfd-3622-3a5b-8b7c-c3906c5f414a",
                                "text": "Vous voici donc en face de 15 affirmations, allant de « Je me sentirais désespéré(e) si Trucmuche me quittait » à « Je sens que mon corps réagit quand Trucmuche me touche », en passant par « Je veux que Trucmuche me connaisse – mes pensées, mes craintes, mes espoirs »."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0be84ef2-0e99-4993-9278-d63a43a14e45",
                                "sense_id": "c7a3acfd-3622-3a5b-8b7c-c3906c5f414a",
                                "text": "M. et Mme Trucmuche sont mariés sous le régime légal (communauté réduite aux acquêts), ont deux enfants et souhaitent acquérir leur résidence principale dont ils ont signés le compromis de vente pour un montant de 250 000 €."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": [
                    {
                        "linkage_id": "95e9ac5b-4629-411e-ae8a-95e74f7044ce",
                        "source_entry_id": "f36c888b-fd6e-32f1-8975-77cb30d59968",
                        "source_sense_ids": [
                            "c7a3acfd-3622-3a5b-8b7c-c3906c5f414a"
                        ],
                        "linkage_type": "synonyms",
                        "word": "Machin"
                    },
                    {
                        "linkage_id": "5f3697f1-2549-4bf0-9fa0-131a7ac10655",
                        "source_entry_id": "f36c888b-fd6e-32f1-8975-77cb30d59968",
                        "source_sense_ids": [
                            "c7a3acfd-3622-3a5b-8b7c-c3906c5f414a"
                        ],
                        "linkage_type": "synonyms",
                        "word": "Truc machinchouette"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "5b75071a-05dd-32d7-8d23-92551d92934a",
                "word": "trucmuche",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "794b06f1-7a90-4223-90c3-de81d29ebcba",
                        "entry_id": "5b75071a-05dd-32d7-8d23-92551d92934a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "trucmuches"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f367af68-a582-3ac9-acab-af19fdf4ac01",
                        "entry_id": "5b75071a-05dd-32d7-8d23-92551d92934a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Truc ; chose dont on ne connait pas ou on ne se souvient pas du nom."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2562b07c-4e2b-4479-aff4-080e63145a97",
                                "sense_id": "f367af68-a582-3ac9-acab-af19fdf4ac01",
                                "text": "— C’est pas assez, tout ça, même si tu manges pas beaucoup, et qu’t’as l’boyau plat.\n— D’puis deux jours, une soupe : un trucmuche jaune brillant comme de l'or. Pas du bouillon, d’la friture ! Tout est resté."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "239f2861-d512-4678-b717-e4e22f0f74d8",
                                "sense_id": "f367af68-a582-3ac9-acab-af19fdf4ac01",
                                "text": "Toutes proportions gardées, les terminaisons âmes et âtes nous font un peu l’effet aujourd’hui de ces suffixes argotiques qui allongent de vieux mots bien simples d’une traîne baroque , mortorama, burlingue, trucmuche ; on s’en amuse : elles sont devenues comiques."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04bfb945-eb8e-4ccc-a1f1-48953091a626",
                                "sense_id": "f367af68-a582-3ac9-acab-af19fdf4ac01",
                                "text": "C’est que je viens de passer une heure au Macy’s, à suivre une gamine surexcitée et qui s’énerve après moi, parce que je ne sais pas faire la différence entre un tee-shirt machin chose et un trucmuche ! Et plus c’est laid, et mieux c’est."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd102260-e814-4bcf-b326-68497987249e",
                                "sense_id": "f367af68-a582-3ac9-acab-af19fdf4ac01",
                                "text": "— Le paquet de pain complet est fermé par un tortillon, le pain de mie par un... trucmuche. Tu sais, ce bout de plastique avec une fente.\n— Trucmuche décrit ça très bien. Va pour le pain complet. Sans beurre. Je suis au régime."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e90ea90-c1ea-4c07-9eea-323e4b8fb0bf",
                                "sense_id": "f367af68-a582-3ac9-acab-af19fdf4ac01",
                                "text": "– D’où vous savez tout ça ? Et qu’est-ce que les Wernige… trucmuche et les Zeydlitz ont à faire avec les Kaltensee ?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2c82567b-4b60-4690-8816-02e6c59e8d77",
                        "source_entry_id": "5b75071a-05dd-32d7-8d23-92551d92934a",
                        "source_sense_id": "f367af68-a582-3ac9-acab-af19fdf4ac01",
                        "target_lang_word": "thingamajig",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "thingamajig",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a325e51b-28b0-3fba-bc55-662a76d31708",
                                        "entry_id": "bee4e66a-ae48-39cf-8569-7df4d9dcca5d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that one does not know the name of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79514ef4-27c2-4969-a362-b22cffb2d6b2",
                                                "sense_id": "a325e51b-28b0-3fba-bc55-662a76d31708",
                                                "text": "He used this, this... this thingamajig you saw him with the other day to fix the problem."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e50cfab7-8ed4-40d4-8994-4eaae7848b86",
                                                "sense_id": "a325e51b-28b0-3fba-bc55-662a76d31708",
                                                "text": "\"– – Engeneerin' is a cinch – All y' gotta do is shove one thingamajigg an' pull 'nother – –\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1210d8f-683a-48af-af81-f113500cb46b",
                                                "sense_id": "a325e51b-28b0-3fba-bc55-662a76d31708",
                                                "text": "STORAGE boxes -- catchalls for flotsam, jetsam, whatnots and thingamajigs -- are gaining new interest as decorative objects for the home."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8a167012-0db2-4cd6-95fd-06ba8776846f",
                        "source_entry_id": "5b75071a-05dd-32d7-8d23-92551d92934a",
                        "source_sense_id": "f367af68-a582-3ac9-acab-af19fdf4ac01",
                        "target_lang_word": "thingy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "thingy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6472cd9-6772-3817-b2e4-001248071c19",
                                        "entry_id": "1ee02249-fa19-3085-8fa2-3b1954779b70",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thing (used to refer to something vaguely or when one cannot recall or does not wish to mention its name)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66882a7e-e953-4322-b3ac-d6e0dc44b015",
                                                "sense_id": "b6472cd9-6772-3817-b2e4-001248071c19",
                                                "text": "And as soon as that temperature returns to normal, let’s talk about the thingies that go through your headie at night."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbabeca3-547c-4b28-a73d-7f37cc4edc46",
                                                "sense_id": "b6472cd9-6772-3817-b2e4-001248071c19",
                                                "text": "What I should really do, of course, is use a Personal Digital Assistant; one of those tiny hand-held computerette thingies […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "066ae51a-5cae-419d-86b7-78fb8b9819b9",
                                                "sense_id": "b6472cd9-6772-3817-b2e4-001248071c19",
                                                "text": "The incorporated technology is based on absolutely serious alt-fact science—that old familiar Einsteiny, time dilation thingy only in reverse— which also forms the basis of much of LaLa Valley's tech AI prowess."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed111c8e-976e-3851-b45d-cb94cbf335fb",
                                        "entry_id": "1ee02249-fa19-3085-8fa2-3b1954779b70",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A penis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "childish",
                                            "euphemistic",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b3c9381-a489-42d3-a9b7-873c8850df2b",
                                                "sense_id": "ed111c8e-976e-3851-b45d-cb94cbf335fb",
                                                "text": "He pulled out his thingy. It was huge."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "thingy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a34e2416-44ca-3728-a041-733a0a6ee084",
                                        "entry_id": "2806c201-8856-31b3-93f9-e46b06f91121",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person whose name one cannot recall."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e80d7e25-7f3a-4c64-8fb0-4833b5ead0f7",
                                                "sense_id": "a34e2416-44ca-3728-a041-733a0a6ee084",
                                                "text": "He reminds me of thingy from that film."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "thingy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6306d748-069f-3306-8ccd-6370ee476947",
                                        "entry_id": "911eea6f-79a5-34e6-be70-e20ff9d72edb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resembling or characteristic of a thing; tangible."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "617434ca-54a5-42ce-abe5-2fd6d36148d7",
                                                "sense_id": "6306d748-069f-3306-8ccd-6370ee476947",
                                                "text": "The most unpleasant, and also the thingiest, the central thing in Foreign Parts, was a giant banyan tree, putting out more and more suckers which created tangled arches, a swollen hiding-place of a tree, a series of organic traps, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "055c5cb5-369d-4f0c-8c7b-40c5604c3797",
                                                "sense_id": "6306d748-069f-3306-8ccd-6370ee476947",
                                                "text": "The secret of even the thingiest SF, the most solid-walnut-to-the-knuckles fantasy, is that you don't need much to summon worlds out of air, so long as the details are the right ones."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
